{"uid":"cli/commands/marketplace.py::MarketplaceCommandSet.do_marketplace","name":"do_marketplace","qualname":"MarketplaceCommandSet.do_marketplace","kind":"method","file":"cli/commands/marketplace.py","line":104,"end_line":176,"language":"py","signature":"def do_marketplace(self, line)","params":[{"name":"line","annotation":"","default":"","kind":"positional"}],"returns":"","decorators":["cmd2.with_category(miscellaneous_category)"],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"Discover and install community plugins, addons, and tools.","description":"Usage:\n    marketplace list [--tier official|community|experimental]\n    marketplace search <name>  - search for available plugins\n    marketplace install <name> - install a plugin by name\n    marketplace update         - refresh community plugin index\n    marketplace update-addons [name|--all] [--dry-run] - git update lazyaddons\n    marketplace info <name>    - show details about a plugin\n    marketplace rate <name> <1-5> - rate a plugin (operator-local)\n    marketplace ratings [name] - show recorded ratings\n    marketplace config         - interactive enable/disable wizard","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":["marketplace list\nmarketplace list --tier official\nmarketplace search c2\nmarketplace install phantom2\nmarketplace rate phantom2 5\nmarketplace config"],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"google"},"parent":"cli/commands/marketplace.py::MarketplaceCommandSet","members":[],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":false,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":["core/console.py::print_error","core/console.py::print_msg"],"called_by":[]}
{"uid":"cli/commands/marketplace.py::MarketplaceCommandSet.do_marketplace_config","name":"do_marketplace_config","qualname":"MarketplaceCommandSet.do_marketplace_config","kind":"method","file":"cli/commands/marketplace.py","line":447,"end_line":488,"language":"py","signature":"def do_marketplace_config(self, line)","params":[{"name":"line","annotation":"","default":"","kind":"positional"}],"returns":"","decorators":["cmd2.with_category(miscellaneous_category)"],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"Interactive marketplace manager (Textual TUI).","description":"Opens the same style of console as ``lazy_orchestrator``:\nsearchable tabs for lazyaddons, plugins, tools, YARA rules and\nNuclei templates, with a preview pane.\n\nUsage:\n    marketplace_config            - open the interactive console\n    marketplace_config show       - print a text summary\n    marketplace_config enable <n> - enable a plugin by name\n    marketplace_config disable <n> - disable a plugin by name\n\nKeys: ``/`` filter, Space toggles (YAML ``enabled`` or tool\n``active``), ``a``/``n`` enable/disable all, ``e`` edits the raw\nfile, ``c`` creates from the tab template, ``d`` deletes after\nconfirmation, ``r`` rescans, Enter saves, Escape cancels.","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"cli/commands/marketplace.py::MarketplaceCommandSet","members":[],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":false,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":["cli/marketplace_config.py::marketplace_summary","core/console.py::print_error","core/console.py::print_msg"],"called_by":[]}
